<title>IRAQ: SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT PAKISTAN 6-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT PAKISTAN 6-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq beat Pakistan 6-1 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group nine qualifying match</p>
<p>on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iraq - Laith Hussein 12, 27, 70, Saheb Abbas 73, Hussam</p>
<p>Fawazi 77, Sadeq Shaaban 90</p>
<p>Pakistan - Mohammed Umer 60</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>    Standings     P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Kazakhstan	 3   3   0   0  12    1    9</p>
<p> Iraq		 3   2   0   1  13    5    6</p>
<p> Pakistan	   4   0   0   4   3   22    0</p>
<p>Remaining match: June 29 - Kazakhstan v Iraq</p>
</text>
